    "gp_section_543064657175250166": {
      "type": "gp-section-543064657175250166",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "9ec2395508d213d9cea20e9ce9eb3d0b4cfca636ed0808a3668a49231d41fd06_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg_dTek_HVb_text": "<span style=\"color:#DB2225;\">FAQs</span>",
        "ggtI_zisFbe_text": "<p>Please take a look at the our most common-asked questions! If you can’t find what you’re looking for or have additional questions, please don’t hesitate to contact us at <u>support@wellnessnest.co</u>. We’re always here to help!</p>",
        "gg2RtFR82gu_childItem_0": "<p><strong>How do I qualify for the free Shilajit Essential Extract?</strong></p>",
        "gg2RtFR82gu_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Can I use this offer with other discounts?</strong></p>",
        "gg2RtFR82gu_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:NaNpx;\"><strong>The price after discount is $98.98. Does the discount still apply if the total is below $100?</strong></span></p>",
        "gg2RtFR82gu_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:NaNpx;\"><strong>Who are these bundles for?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggJTs66VujL_text": "<p>Simply spend $100 or more, and it will automatically be added at checkout. Plus, our 80% discount and free shipping are also counted!</p>",
        "gga56q2ep-B_text": "<p>Yes, absolutely! You can combine this offer with other discounts and promotions. We want you to enjoy the best value possible, so feel free to stack up the savings!</p>",
        "gg3mZdOSO63_text": "<p>Great question! Our deal applies to orders with an <strong>original price over $100</strong>, even if the discounted price falls below $100. For example, a bundle originally priced at $120 but discounted to $98.98 still qualifies for the Black Friday offer. Shop with confidence knowing you’re getting the full deal!</p>",
        "gg8xIu-yjUZ_text": "<ul><li><strong>Energy &amp; Vitality Bundle:</strong> Perfect for anyone needing a quick energy boost and long-lasting vitality, such as busy professionals, parents, or active individuals.</li><li><strong>Hormonal Harmony Bundle (For Women):</strong> Tailored for women looking to balance hormones, reduce inflammation, and enhance overall wellness, especially during menopause or hormonal changes.</li><li><strong>Muscle Recovery &amp; Performance Bundle (For Men):</strong> Best for men focused on muscle recovery, strength building, and improving physical performance, such as athletes or gym enthusiasts.</li><li><strong>Cognitive &amp; Stress-Free Bundle:</strong> Ideal for those looking to improve focus, reduce brain fog, and stay calm under stress, including students, multitaskers, and high-pressure workers.</li><li><strong>Ultimate Energy &amp; Recovery Bundle:</strong> Designed for individuals seeking an all-in-one solution for energy, immunity, and recovery—perfect for high performers or those with demanding lifestyles.</li></ul>"
      }
    },
